[PrintTextModified Text:噩梦般的魔女审判已成过往。<br>翌日，少女们来到会客厅集合。|#0102Adv02_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在早餐时间，艾玛向众人提议<br>大家先坐到一起好好谈一谈。|#0102Adv02_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:于是，少女们迈着沉重的步伐<br>陆续走进了会客厅。|#0102Adv02_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——然而。|#0102Adv02_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_26_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:你跟我们都不是一路人好吗！|#0102Adv02_Alisa001| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:很快就起了冲突。<br>亚里沙对米莉亚怒吼道。|#0102Adv02_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HidePrinter
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:5_2 SubId:Middle
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:40 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmR2,ArmL7 SubId:Middle
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1,ArmR4,ArmL3 SubId:Middle
@Wait WaitMode:0.3

[PrintTextModified Text:你个大叔凑过来干什么！<br>你跟我们不一样！滚出去！|#0102Adv02_Alisa002| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:呀！对、对不起！|#0102Adv02_Miria001| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:65 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR12 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:是我提议让大家一起谈一谈的，<br>米莉亚她没有错！|#0102Adv02_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛立即介入调解两人的冲突。|#0102Adv02_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:65 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Determined2,ArmR12 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:我们应该互帮互助才对。<br>所以，大家一起谈谈吧。|#0102Adv02_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚，亚里沙，<br>我希望你们都能留在这里。|#0102Adv02_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……你想说的就这些？<br>我可不想搞什么你帮我我帮你的。|#0102Adv02_Alisa003| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:谁想跟骗人精做朋友。<br>我连那家伙的脸都不想看到。|#0102Adv02_Alisa004| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Alisa-Middle Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:丢下这番话后，<br>亚里沙离开了会客厅。|#0102Adv02_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:呜、呜呜……看来大叔我真的很烦人吧……<br>对不起，害你们感到不舒服……|#0102Adv02_Miria002| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:"（虽然米莉亚身上的确谜团重重……<br>　不过我想暂时先相信她）|#0102Adv02_Ema004|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛带着几分紧张，转身对米莉亚说道。|#0102Adv02_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3 SubId:Middle
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1,ArmR4,ArmL3 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:没关系的。米莉亚，我叫你来<br>是希望你也能帮助大家。|#0102Adv02_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，对了，我可以直接叫你<br>米莉亚吗……？|#0102Adv02_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Cry1,ArmR4,ArmL3 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:当然可以……！|#0102Adv02_Miria003| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚十分激动，<br>连连用力点头。|#0102Adv02_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙已经离开了现场。<br>艾玛看向仍在场的几名少女。|#0102Adv02_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚、汉娜、雪莉、梅露露、<br>可可、玛格、安安。<br>再算上艾玛，一共8个人。|#0102Adv02_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Determined2 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:说真的，我们必须得逃出这里。|#0102Adv02_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:面对一众囚犯少女，<br>艾玛毅然开口说道。|#0102Adv02_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅之前呼吁我们老实遵守规定，<br>可是留在这里我们也无法得救。|#0102Adv02_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛原本就在四处游说越狱的事，<br>雪莉、汉娜、梅露露三人<br>也早就是她的同伴了。|#0102Adv02_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:听到艾玛的话，她们三人都用力点头。<br>……但，问题在于原先不愿意配合的几位少女。|#0102Adv02_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Normal1,Angle01/Option_Arms- SubId:Middle
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1 SubId:Middle
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1,ArmR2 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:话虽如此，<br>但违反规定的话，就要被带去惩罚室哦。|#0102Adv02_Margo001| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Normal1,Arms2,Angle01/Option_Arms>Option_Arms02_01,Angle01/Option_ArmR/Option_ArmR01_01- SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:『吾辈觉得不应该做违规的事』|#0102Adv02_AnAn001| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我也想逃出这个鬼地方啊，<br>可是反抗的话，一个不走运甚至可能会被看守干掉啊。|#0102Adv02_Coco001| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就像二阶堂希罗一样。|#0102Adv02_Margo002| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛痛苦地低下头。|#0102Adv02_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

