[PrintTextModified Text:希罗、诺亚……还有蕾雅。<br>大家被抓到这里来以后已经牺牲了三个人。|#0102Adv02_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HidePrinter
@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:MainBackground Loop:false
@SpawnExtended Path:MaskingRectangle Params:200,200,true,0.5,#000000cc ScenePosition:-7,50 Rotation:,,-10 SubId:Forefront
