@Wait WaitMode:0.3

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅她是自作自受吧。<br>谁让她杀人了。|#0102Adv02_Coco002| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:75 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Determined2,ArmR3 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:如果不是在这种处境下，就不会闹出这种事了。<br>就像奈叶香说的那样，我们都被玩弄了！|#0102Adv02_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:再在这里待下去，<br>等待我们的只有最悲惨的未来。|#0102Adv02_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一定有什么办法，<br>可以不被它们发现偷偷逃出去。|#0102Adv02_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们一起逃走吧！<br>只要大家齐心协力，一定能找到出路！|#0102Adv02_Ema013| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:25,30 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR2 SubId:Forefront

[PrintTextModified Text:吐了。|#0102Adv02_Coco003| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:75 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Angry1,ArmR3 SubId:Front

; ＠備考◆カッとしかかる

[PrintTextModified Text:……|#0102Adv02_Ema014| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看到可可的反应，艾玛的脸色变得有些严肃。<br>但很快，她就无奈地露出沮丧的神情。|#0102Adv02_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:75 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:（看样子，大家是不可能齐心协力的吧……）|#0102Adv02_Ema015| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HidePrinter
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:5_2
