[PrintTextModified Text:这时，玛格往前走了一步。|#0102Adv02_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1 SubId:Middle
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛你真的很了不起。<br>像我呢，就做不到信任所有人。|#0102Adv02_Margo003| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格……可、可是，<br>如果我们不团结在一起的话！|#0102Adv02_Ema016| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1,ArmR6 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:呵呵呵，别担心。<br>我同意大家一起齐心协力越狱的想法，<br>因为这样做比较合理。我会帮助你的。|#0102Adv02_Margo004| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:真的！？太、太好了……|#0102Adv02_Ema017| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmR1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:可可，你也想离开这里吧？|#0102Adv02_Margo005| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR2,ArmL2 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:呃，算是吧……|#0102Adv02_Coco004| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:见可可不情不愿地点头，<br>玛格便微微一笑。|#0102Adv02_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

@StopBgm
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmR2 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:我们来正式制定一下越狱的计划吧。<br>首先我们得确定团队的领导者。|#0102Adv02_Margo006| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:从各位之前的表现来看，<br>我认为让艾玛担任队长比较合适。|#0102Adv02_Margo007| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR3 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:什么，我、我吗……！？|#0102Adv02_Ema018| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_19_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmR1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，是你一直在努力团结大家。<br>有人反对吗？|#0102Adv02_Margo008| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:没有人提出异议。|#0102Adv02_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（原来，大家并不讨厌我啊……）|#0102Adv02_Ema019| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:作为团队核心得到了大家的信任，<br>这让艾玛不禁绽放出花一般的笑容。|#0102Adv02_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR8,ArmL8 SubId:Middle
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1 SubId:Middle
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmR1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:对了，要不要做下那个仪式？<br>大家手叠在一起，大喊鼓舞士气的那个。|#0102Adv02_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:亏你能想到这么尴尬的仪式。|#0102Adv02_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmR3 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:是吗，我觉得很好啊。<br>确实需要一个仪式把大家的心团结在一起。|#0102Adv02_Margo009| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格露出妖艳的微笑，<br>向前伸出手。|#0102Adv02_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile,ArmR5 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:接下来就靠你了，艾玛。|#0102Adv02_Margo010| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉和梅露露将手放在玛格的手上，接着，<br>汉娜和可可也不情不愿地跟着把手放了上去。|#0102Adv02_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而米莉亚也小心翼翼地把手轻轻放了上去，<br>尽量不碰到任何人。|#0102Adv02_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:接着，艾玛把手放到最上面。|#0102Adv02_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Determined2,ArmR1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:我们所有人都要一起活着离开这里！<br>说好了！谁都不准背叛大家！|#0102Adv02_Ema020| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:少女们的心，如同重叠的手心般紧紧团结在一起。|#0102Adv02_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（感觉有底气多了……！）|#0102Adv02_Ema021| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:那我们赶快开始制定——|#0102Adv02_Ema022| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Pensive1,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR1,ArmL1,ArmR1-Option-All SubId:Middle
@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:AnAn-Middle Loop:false ScenePositionY:30 Duration:0.6

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛刚信心十足地开口宣言，<br>安安却突然无力地蹲了下来。|#0102Adv02_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她不知何时离开了众人的包围圈，<br>面色铁青，似乎身体不太舒服。|#0102Adv02_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安，你怎么了……？<br>没事吧……？|#0102Adv02_Ema023| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0102Adv02_AnAn002| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:她没有说话，只是摇了摇头。|#0102Adv02_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:又、又贫血了吗……<br>最好先带她去一趟<br>医务室……|#0102Adv02_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（安安好像身体比较虚弱，<br>　精神消耗肯定也不小……）|#0102Adv02_Ema024|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而且，米莉亚小姐看起来……也、也有点不舒服……|#0102Adv02_Meruru002| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Surprised1,ArmR4,ArmL3 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:欸～|#0102Adv02_Miria004| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚惊讶得往后一退，<br>猛地摇头。|#0102Adv02_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Surprised1,ArmR2,ArmL2 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:没有不舒服啦！我好着呢！<br>大叔我好得很啦！|#0102Adv02_Miria005| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:不、不是的。我一直有点担心你……<br>感觉你特别消沉，我就很担心……|#0102Adv02_Meruru003| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你一直都很累吧……！<br>我看你……好像负担很重的样子……|#0102Adv02_Meruru004| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那是因为沾染上了大叔的习性，<br>平时就半死不活的啦！|#0102Adv02_Miria006| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:今、今天就让我来照顾你一下，好吗……|#0102Adv02_Meruru005| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Meruru-Middle Loop:false ScenePositionX:45 Duration:0.6

[PrintTextModified Text:泪眼婆娑的梅露露一步步靠近米莉亚。|#0102Adv02_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不要勉强自己了，<br>你们一起去医务室好好休息吧。|#0102Adv02_Ema025| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1,ArmR6,ArmL6 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:呜呜……谢谢你……<br>对不起，我太没用了……|#0102Adv02_Miria007| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:在梅露露的陪同下，<br>安安和米莉亚离开了会客厅。|#0102Adv02_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:转眼间可可也不见了踪影。<br>剩下的只有艾玛、雪莉和汉娜。|#0102Adv02_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:以及玛格。|#0102Adv02_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:你们啊，究竟有没有干劲啊！？|#0102Adv02_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:算了……毕竟昨晚都被折磨得精疲力竭。<br>不过我觉得是时候紧张起来了……|#0102Adv02_Ema026| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛放心不下的是<br>奈叶香在失踪前留下的话。|#0102Adv02_Narrative034| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:"（她之前说没有时间了……<br>　难道说有什么时间限制吗）|#0102Adv02_Ema027|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（如果真是那样，<br>　我们得赶紧行动起来……）|#0102Adv02_Ema028|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:我们几个人<br>先商量一下越狱计划吧。|#0102Adv02_Ema029| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1 SubId:Middle
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR10,ArmL1 SubId:Middle
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmR1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:这样比较好，<br>人少点方便统一意见。|#0102Adv02_Margo011| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可是放风时间<br>马上就要结束了。|#0102Adv02_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:可恶！总是事不如愿！|#0102Adv02_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那我们就等晚餐后的放风时间<br>再碰面吧。|#0102Adv02_Margo012| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmR6 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:正好我有东西想给你们看，<br>你们可以来我的房间集合吗？|#0102Adv02_Margo013| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你的房间……是指地下的牢房？|#0102Adv02_Ema030| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（那牢房很小……不过四个人的话，也许能塞得下？<br>　毕竟她的室友奈叶香不在）|#0102Adv02_Ema031|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格点点头，<br>随后便露出意味深长的笑容。|#0102Adv02_Narrative035| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1,ArmR1,ArmL4 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，欢迎大家来我的房间做客。|#0102Adv02_Margo014| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndAdv

@GotoModified Path:Act01_Chapter02/Act01_Chapter02_Adv03 SoftReset:true

